guide forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh
title Dustwallow Marsh & Desolace
faction Horde
levels 39-41
zone Dustwallow Marsh
next forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale

# Consensus route (Horde, simulator export consensus-horde-tauren). Written
# from an earlier export's visits 29-30 (Dustwallow Marsh 39.2-39.8, Desolace
# 39.8-40.2); the October refresh's export has the same two stays as visits
# 25 (Dustwallow 38.5-39.1) and 29 (Desolace 40.4-40.9), with the Badlands
# and the Swamp of Sorrows between them; this guide keeps the two together.
# Shared by every Horde start. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Ratchet -> fly to Camp Taurajo -> the Shady Rest Inn -> Brackenwall
# Village (flight path) -> the Quagmire (Ogron) -> Witch
# Hill (Stinky, Mirefin murlocs, Swamp Eye Jarl) -> Darkfang spiders,
# Theramore Infiltrators and the Darkmist Cavern -> Brackenwall -> Jarl ->
# Brackenwall -> hearth to Ratchet -> fly to
# Shadowprey Village (bind) -> the Valley of Spears escort -> the Kodo
# Graveyard -> the Gizelton caravan -> Ghost Walker Post -> Kormek's Hut ->
# the Kodo Graveyard -> Kormek's Hut -> Thunder Axe Fortress -> Ethel Rethor
# and the Slitherblade coast -> the Valley of Spears -> Shadowprey ->
# Mannoroc Coven -> Ghost Walker Post -> hearth to Shadowprey.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Shady Rest pick-ups (Suspicious Hoofprints 1268, The Black Shield
#   1251, Lieutenant Paval Reethe 1269) are in Dustwallow, at the burned inn
#   on the road from Camp Taurajo; the export files them under the Barrens.
#   All three go to Krog together on arrival, so Do'gol's venom sacs are
#   gathered in the same loop as the rest.
# - Stinky's Escape (1270): the export escorts Stinky but never hands it in.
#   It is turned in to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet after the hearth there,
#   which the route makes anyway.
# - Jarl Needs a Blade (1203) is optional: the Moonsteel Broadsword is a
#   Blacksmithing item (or the Auction House), nothing drops it.
# - Desolace: Kormek's Hut is visited twice (Bone Collector needs the quest
#   before the bones can be picked up); the Thunder Axe box and Ethel Rethor
#   follow on the second visit.
# - Theramore Spies (1201), Soothing Spices (1218) and the Loose Dirt pair
#   (1238, 1239) come from forever/horde/07-ashenvale, where they were level 35
#   quests at 30. The Lost Report (1238) is read at Brackenwall before the
#   dirt gives up The Severed Head (1239), so the second Jarl visit ends with
#   a ride back to Brackenwall. The Troll Witchdoctor (1240) goes to Grom'gol
#   in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale.
# - Added in the October refresh, from the new consensus (Forever above 30
#   cannot be checked in game until launch on 4 November: these come from
#   the data, not from play):
#   - The Kolkar of Desolace (1362): taken from Regthar Deathgate in
#     forever/horde/30-40/03-arathi-highlands and handed to Felgur Twocuts at
#     Ghost Walker Post, beside Smeed's camp where the caravan ends.
#   - Carved Centaur Totems (93225, new in Forever): Gurda Wildmane at Ghost
#     Walker Post. The quest text says any centaur clan; the data's drop
#     list names only the Maraudine (Questie Forever), so the totems are
#     taken in the Valley of Spears on the ride from Ethel Rethor back to
#     Shadowprey, and handed in on a ride north from Mannoroc Coven before
#     the hearth.
#
# Class quests: none; Shamans handed Brine their waterskin (1536) in
# forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills.
#
# Left out: Claim Rackmore's Treasure! (6161): its two keys come from the
# north coast naga and the crabs by Shadowprey, and the chest sits on
# Ranazjar Isle in the far north, a crossing of the whole zone for one quest.
# The centaur clan chains, Classic and Forever, which the new consensus
# takes at 40: Ongeku (1373), Khan Jehn (1374), A Conqueror's Crown (92743),
# Valley of Bones (93034), Ravaging Ravagers (93035), Facing the Truth
# (93041), Outing Outcasts (93037) and Forever's Khan Jehn (93128). The
# Classic steps need Friendly with the Magram or Gelkis, and from Valley of
# Bones on Honored (wowf.io, "Magram Quest Chain (Khan Jehn)"), earned only
# by killing the rival clan (see forever/horde/30-40/01-desolace); since the
# 8 October beta notes, Valley of Bones and its follow-ups need level 35. The
# Conqueror's Crown comes from the Badlands, which the data cannot place,
# and Nerlokh stands in the new Shen'dralas zone south of Desolace.
# Marg Speaks (1261) and Report to Zor (1262): Marg's note in Grom'gol is
# offered only after The Troll Witchdoctor (1240), which now comes after this
# guide, and the Jeweled Pendant drops one crab in twenty.
# The Black Shield (1276) is not taken: its Thunder Bluff turn-in is not on
# the route.
# The export's closing Booty Bay bind belongs to the next guide, which
# starts there.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the marsh

step Fly to Camp Taurajo
  zone The Barrens
  sethome "Ratchet" npc 6791          -- Innkeeper Wiley: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  fly "Camp Taurajo"

step Shady Rest Inn
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Ride east from Camp Taurajo along the road into the marsh. The burned-out Shady Rest Inn stands beside it just past the border; the shield, the badge and the hoofprints are in and beside the ruin.
  accept 1251
  accept 1268
  accept 1269

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Brackenwall Village

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Take the road north at the fork to the ogre village of Brackenwall.
  getfp "Brackenwall Village"
  turnin 1269                         -- Krog
  turnin 1251
  turnin 1268
  accept 1321
  turnin 1321                         -- Do'gol
  accept 1322
  accept 1177                         -- Mudcrush Durtfeet, at the south edge of the village
  accept 1201                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike

step Questioning Reethe
  tip Ogron waits in the Quagmire east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out.
  accept 1273
  complete 1273

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Witch Hill

step Stinky Ignatz
  tip Ride north to Witch Hill. Stinky stands at the foot of the hill; escort him while he gathers Bogbean Leaves just south of it.
  accept 1270
  complete 1270

step Mirefin murlocs
  tip The Mirefin murlocs crowd the coast east and north-east of Witch Hill; every kind drops heads.
  collect 5847 quest 1177

step Swamp Eye Jarl
  tip Jarl lives in the Swamplight Manor south-east of Witch Hill.
  accept 1218                         -- "Swamp Eye" Jarl
  turnin 1218
  accept 1238                         -- Loose Dirt, beside the manor
  accept 1206

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back west

step Darkfang spiders
  tip Ride west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Venomspitters on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely.
  collect 5959 quest 1322
  kill 4834 quest 1201

step Darkmist Cavern
  tip The Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes.
  collect 5884 quest 1206

step Brackenwall Village
  turnin 1273                         -- Krog
  turnin 1201                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  turnin 1238
  turnin 1177                         -- Mudcrush Durtfeet
  turnin 1322                         -- Do'gol
  accept 1323
  turnin 1323                         -- Krog

step Swamp Eye Jarl
  tip Ride east back to the Swamplight Manor.
  turnin 1206
  accept 1203 optional                -- only if you carry a Moonsteel Broadsword (Blacksmithing or the Auction House)
  turnin 1203 optional
  accept 1239                         -- Loose Dirt, now that Nazeer has read the report

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Ride back west to Brackenwall with the head.
  turnin 1239                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  accept 1240                         -- For Kin'weelay at Grom'gol, in the next guide

step Hearth to Ratchet
  hearth "Ratchet"
  turnin 1270                         -- Mebok Mizzyrix

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  fly "Shadowprey Village"
  sethome "Shadowprey Village"
  accept 5381                         -- Taiga Wisemane
  accept 6143                         -- Drulzegar Skraghook

step Melizza Brimbuzzle
  tip Ride north-east to the Valley of Spears. Melizza is held in the Maraudine centaur camp; free her and escort her out east of the valley.
  accept 6132
  complete 6132

step Kodo Graveyard
  tip Hornizz waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard.
  turnin 6132
  accept 6134

step Gizelton Caravan
  tip Rigger Gizelton's caravan stops on the road at the edge of Mannoroc Coven. Escort it east past the coven; demons attack it twice.
  accept 5943
  complete 5943

step Scrabblescrew's Camp
  tip The caravan ends at Smeed's camp on the east side of the Kodo Graveyard.
  turnin 5943

step Ghost Walker Post
  tip Felgur Twocuts and Gurda Wildmane stand in the post just west of Smeed's camp.
  turnin 1362                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  accept 93225                        -- Gurda Wildmane

step Kormek's Hut
  tip Ride north up the road to the hut by the road north of the graveyard.
  accept 5501                         -- Bibbly F'utzbuckle

step Kodo bones and ghosts
  tip Pick up the kodo bones scattered across the graveyard, and use the Crate of Ghost Magnets among the bones: the ghosts it draws drop the ghost-o-plasm.
  collect 13703 quest 5501
  complete 6134

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  turnin 6134

step Kormek's Hut
  turnin 5501                         -- Bibbly F'utzbuckle

step Thunder Axe Fortress
  tip The Burning Blade hold the fortress north-west of Kormek's Hut. Use the Demon Pick on the Demon Spirit in the fortress to get the Demon Box.
  collect 13542 quest 5381

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The coast

step Ethel Rethor
  tip Ride west to Azore Aldamort's tower at Ethel Rethor on the north-west coast.
  accept 6027                         -- Azore Aldamort

step Slitherblade coast
  tip The Slitherblade naga hold the coast north of Ethel Rethor, up to Sar'theris Strand. Lord Kragaru guards the Book of the Ancients at the far northern tip.
  kill 4714 quest 6143.1
  kill 4711 quest 6143.2
  kill 4712 quest 6143.3
  collect 15803 quest 6027

step Azore Aldamort
  turnin 6027

step Maraudine totems
  tip Ride south from Ethel Rethor into the Valley of Spears. The Maraudine Scouts, Wranglers, Maulers, Windchasers and Marauders (36-39) drop the Carved Centaur Totems.
  collect 254432 x5 quest 93225.1

step Shadowprey Village
  tip Ride on south-west to Shadowprey.
  turnin 5381                         -- Taiga Wisemane
  accept 5581
  turnin 6143                         -- Drulzegar Skraghook

step Portals of the Legion
  tip Ride east to Mannoroc Coven. Use the Rod of Banishing by each demon portal to close six of them.
  goto 52.0,78.0 "Mannoroc Coven"
  complete 5581

step Ghost Walker Post
  tip Ride north from the coven to Gurda Wildmane at Ghost Walker Post.
  turnin 93225                        -- Gurda Wildmane

step Hearth to Shadowprey
  hearth "Shadowprey Village"
  turnin 5581                         -- Taiga Wisemane
  note The next guide takes you back to Stranglethorn Vale.
